    {
      "id": "N-P003-head",
      "text": "## 2. 可测集的开集外逼近与闭集内逼近\n\n以下条件承接原稿引理：$E$ 为 Lebesgue 可测集。",
      "source_ids": [],
      "origin": "editorial",
      "explanation": "把上一页引理起句与本页性质相连。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P003-U001",
      "text": "(1) $\\forall\\varepsilon>0$，$\\exists$ 开集 $G\\supset E$，s.t.\n$$\nm(G\\setminus E)<\\varepsilon.\n$$",
