      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P003-U003",
      "text": "<span style=\"color:red\">原稿提问：与外测度结论区别？</span>\n\n〔问号用蓝色椭圆圈出，原位置未写答。〕",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U003"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
