    },
    {
      "id": "N-P003-S01",
      "text": "> [!info] 补充解答：与外测度逼近结论的区别\n> 外测度定义可对任意集合 $A$ 给出开覆盖，其总体积接近 $m^*(A)$；有限外测度时可得到 $m(G)<m^*(A)+\\varepsilon$。本引理以 **$E$ 可测** 为条件，结论直接控制新增部分 $G\\setminus E$ 的测度。有限测度时，依靠可测性写成 $m(G\\setminus E)=m(G)-m(E)$；无限测度时不能作 $\\infty-\\infty$ 的减法，需要下面的局部分解与可求和误差。闭集内逼近则由补集的外逼近得到。",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U001",
        "RA09-P003-U002",
        "RA09-P003-U003"
      ],
      "origin": "supplement",
      "explanation": "紧接原稿明确提问补全答案，保留原提问标记。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P003-U004",
      "text": "**(1) 当 $m(E)<+\\infty$。**",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U004"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P003-U004",
      "text": "**(1) 当 $m(E)<+\\infty$。**",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U004"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P003-U005",
      "text": "$\\forall\\varepsilon>0$，$\\exists\\{I_i\\}\\in\\mathcal L_c(E)$，s.t.",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U005"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P003-U005",
      "text": "$\\forall\\varepsilon>0$，$\\exists\\{I_i\\}\\in\\mathcal L_c(E)$，s.t.",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U005"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P003-U006",
      "text": "$$\nE\\subset\\bigcup_{i=1}^{\\infty}I_i,\n\\qquad\\sum_i|I_i|<m(E)+\\varepsilon.\n$$",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U006"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
