      "text": "$$\nE\\subset\\bigcup_{i=1}^{\\infty}I_i,\n\\qquad\\sum_i|I_i|<m(E)+\\varepsilon.\n$$",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U006"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "T-P003-U007",
      "text": "$$\nG=\\bigcup_i I_i\\quad\\text{开},\\qquad\nm(G)\\le\\sum_i|I_i|<m(E)+\\varepsilon.\n$$",
      "source_ids": [
        "RA09-P003-U007"
      ],
      "origin": "source",
      "explanation": "按原图保留本单元。",
      "status": "resolved"
    },
    {
      "id": "N-P003-U007",
      "text": "$$\nG=\\bigcup_i I_i\\quad\\text{开},\\qquad\nm(G)\\le\\sum_i|I_i|<m(E)+\\varepsilon.\n$$",
      "source_ids": [
